{"text": "From\n\nMEMORANDUM\n\nRe American Rew Conpany\nMe. J. Waterfilt, cr. Menagee Pare March 15, 1968\nYoutsville Branch\n\n0. N, Coty, Manager - Quality Controt\nResearch and Development\n\nUnder separate cover, we are sending you three (3) experimental lots of\nMONTCIATR blend, packed in separate boxes. Each box contains one lot in\ntwo plastic bags which are tagged to designate the particular lot. This\nfobacco has been cut and flavored and ready for cigarette production.\nThese Samples are descrthed as follows\n\nMONTCLAIR CSM-2 (79 Ibs.)\nMONTCLAIR CSH-2 (83 Ibs.)\nMONTCLAIR CS\u00a5=3 (90 Ibs.)\n\nFor your information all three samples are made up with our current\nMONTCLATR leaf blend and finishing flavor, and differ from each other\nonly in the casing applied, which 1s listed below for each lot.\n\n5\nJot Designation Spray-Casing Applied\nsm Glycerine and Glycol only\ncou? Normal Casing less all sugers\nesu-3 Control - Normal Casing\n\nWe would Like to have twenty-five cartons of cigarettes from each of these\nblends, made to your current specifications for this brand excepting the\nweight/4 oz, for Lots CSM-! and CSH-2. These weights should be controlled\nat 112 cigts/4 oz. for the CSM-1 and 110 cigts/4 oz. for the CSM-2, or\nwhatever weight, in your judgement, will produce a satisfactory firmness.\n\nALI of these cigarettes should be packaged in regular labels and cartons.\nBech carton should be plainly labeled to indicate the lot designation,\n\nThe remainder of this tobacco (all three samples) may be blended in with\nyour regular manufacture.\n\nONC/ro\n\nMe. H. G. French\n\nSie Se te Hager\n\n634010440", "words": [{"text": "From", "x0": 53, "y0": 145, "x1": 85, "y1": 153, "conf": 76.0}, {"text": "MEMORANDUM", "x0": 260, "y0": 55, "x1": 457, "y1": 71, "conf": 89.0}, {"text": "Re", "x0": 254, "y0": 71, "x1": 280, "y1": 106, "conf": 52.0}, {"text": "American", "x0": 280, "y0": 75, "x1": 460, "y1": 102, "conf": 40.0}, {"text": "Rew", "x0": 354, "y0": 7